{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Forged Into History: Speedway Odyssey</i> is an arcade motorbike racing game that lets you take part in an individual fight for the championship in the top league of a speedway competition. Compete over 10 career seasons and prove that you are the true champion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Speedway Odyssey</i> players will see their avatar from a top-down view in a 2D setting on a set of varied round and oval tracks. Your competition for each new game start will be a group of randomly generated AI players of varied difficulty levels.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game allows for up to 4 players to play locally on a single computer. All game modes (single race, single tournament and career) can be played in such a way (for local multiplayer either a keyboard that has capability of supporting multiple buttons pressed at the same time or extra controllers are required). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn your title and don't let other pretenders take it away from you. Show that you are the true legend of speedway!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3447910?t=1749039329","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3447910?t=1749039329","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447910/7d4eed3c74a3f6d745e5cc243b674607b8377f7c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749039329","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447910/7d4eed3c74a3f6d745e5cc243b674607b8377f7c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749039329","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3772320,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Forged Into History: Speedway Odyssey</i> is an arcade motorbike racing game that lets you take part in an individual fight for the championship in the top league of a speedway competition. Compete over 10 career seasons and prove that you are the true champion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Speedway Odyssey</i> players will see their avatar from a top-down view in a 2D setting on a set of varied round and oval tracks. Your competition for each new game start will be a group of randomly generated AI players of varied difficulty levels.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game allows for up to 4 players to play locally on a single computer. All game modes (single race, single tournament and career) can be played in such a way (for local multiplayer either a keyboard that has capability of supporting multiple buttons pressed at the same time or extra controllers are required). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn your title and don't let other pretenders take it away from you. Show that you are the true legend of speedway!</p>","developers":["ARRGAR Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447910/header.jpg?t=1749039329","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257151007,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257151007/movie480.mp4?t=1749039327","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257151007/movie_max.mp4?t=1749039327"},"name":"FIHSO Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257151007/23103dd8f0446c8